Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (=13),
Section: x11
Standards-Version: 3.9.8

Package: nautilus-icon-themes
Architecture: all
Recommends: gnome-icon-theme-gperfection2
Suggests: gnome2000-icon-theme
Section: x11
Description: Icon themes based on Nautilus 1 themes
 All these icons come from Debian 3's Nautilus 1.0.6
 package. They represent themes used by the GNOME 1 desktop
 back before the modern icon theme format existed.
 As arranged here, they can live again in Xfce, etc.
 .
 Included themes:
 * Nautilus (the old default theme)
 * Nautilus Antialiased
    (varient with shadows, set to inherit gperfection2 if installed)
 * Crux-Eggplant
 * Crux-Teal     (to accompany the GTK1 Crux look)
 * Sierra
 * Sierra Antialiased
 * Tahoe
 .
 The original package's GNOME theme is omitted.
 See gnome2000-icon-theme for a modern equivalent.
